      "created_at": "2020-10-05T02:45:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm confused. Let's say you use a power that says \"Defend 1 per Dahan in target land\" on a land with 2 Dahan, and then an event adds one Dahan. You're saying the total amount of defense in that land is now 3? The Trees and Stones Speak of War FAQ seems to say that the amount of defense remains 2.</p>",
