      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-10-05T12:27:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Dpt, it doesn't say \"the existing Dahan can't be affected.\" It says \"the number of Dahan in target land cannot be changed.\" Adding more changes the number. Therefore, I think you can't do it.</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
